  <data name="MapFileBaseLabel.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The GAME DIRECTORY is the root Hired Guns game directory.
If you have the Hired Guns development files, the DEV DIRECTORY can optionally be set to the root directory of the development files.
The development files are only needed if you want to include map data from the unreleased maps in the Locations.dat file.</value>
  </data>
